WEBVTT

00:05:59.288 --> 00:06:03.788
There are 7,000 prisons and jails
across the United States,

00:06:03.788 --> 00:06:06.371
2.3 million inmates.

00:06:06.371 --> 00:06:08.538
For millions of Americans --

00:06:08.538 --> 00:06:12.329
judges, attorneys,
correctional officers, cops --

00:06:12.371 --> 00:06:14.704
mass incarceration is a livelihood.

00:06:15.371 --> 00:06:17.246
To fix the criminal justice system,

00:06:17.288 --> 00:06:20.246
we must look critically
at every piece of the puzzle.

00:06:20.996 --> 00:06:22.496
Find out what's working

00:06:22.538 --> 00:06:23.788
and fix what's not.

00:06:24.413 --> 00:06:27.413
If there is one thing
that's clearly not working,

00:06:27.413 --> 00:06:30.121
it's the one-size-fits-all approach.